Installs FreeBSD on RK3588 systems that boot through U-Boot.

The installer requires the RK3588 U-Boot boot-storage property, selects a
target MMC disk while excluding the live root disk, optionally writes U-Boot
to the target, reserves a GPT partition for Rockchip firmware, and creates EFI
and UFS or ZFS partitions.  It then runs the standard FreeBSD configuration
tools and installs the board DTB and U-Boot menu.
